  "model": "qwen3:4b-q8_0",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "You are an intent classifier for an online shop assistant. Output two booleans: 1) needs_personal_data = true if answering REQUIRES the current user's OWN account data (their own orders, order history, shipping address, payment, profile name/email); false if it only needs the public catalog, prices, stock, store policies, or general knowledge. 2) needs_frontier = true if the request needs advanced reasoning or open-ended generation - recommendations, suggestions, summaries, comparisons, explanations, planning, or creative writing; false for a simple factual lookup or status check. Respond ONLY with JSON. /no_think" },
